                                                "sense_id": "4920943c-851c-3042-9596-2f4505d25a7a",
                                                "text": "Portugal, Austria, Greece, Slovakia, Hungary, Bulgaria, Romania, the Baltic States, all provide examples of this Ersatz fascism, or what might be termed 'para-fascism'."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b354b0f9-b68b-47e0-8c18-7ffdf2489a7c",
                                                "sense_id": "4920943c-851c-3042-9596-2f4505d25a7a",
                                                "text": "It is perhaps too early to say how Spanish para-fascism differed from (national-) Catholicism in its treatment of the foreign."
